{"1354180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Divine Tactics", "steam_appid": 1354180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assume the mantle of a god in Divine Tactics, a mythic autobattler where your intellect is your greatest weapon. Forge an army from heroes and monsters of unique archetypes and roles, each awaiting your command.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354180/extras/70610d1e0cf70746e048188cdd28e5c4.poster.avif?t=1779384160\" width=854 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354180/extras/70610d1e0cf70746e048188cdd28e5c4.webm?t=1779384160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354180/extras/70610d1e0cf70746e048188cdd28e5c4.mp4?t=1779384160\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battleground is your domain, where you position your units with precision, and design formations where every hero has a purpose. Orchestrate their skills and abilities to create combos that shatter the enemy frontline, protect your key assets, and dismantle an opponent's strategy before it can begin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your true challenge lies in defeating the master strategies of other players. You will face the very armies they led to victory, their formations left behind as a challenge for all who follow. Analyze their formation, find the single flaw in their design, and deploy a counter-strategy to watch their grand design crumble to dust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick. Position. Prevail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game uses licensed assets from SMITE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assume the mantle of a god in Divine Tactics, a mythic autobattler where your intellect is your greatest weapon. Forge an army from heroes and monsters of unique archetypes and roles, each awaiting your command.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354180/extras/70610d1e0cf70746e048188cdd28e5c4.poster.avif?t=1779384160\" width=854 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354180/extras/70610d1e0cf70746e048188cdd28e5c4.webm?t=1779384160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354180/extras/70610d1e0cf70746e048188cdd28e5c4.mp4?t=1779384160\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battleground is your domain, where you position your units with precision, and design formations where every hero has a purpose. Orchestrate their skills and abilities to create combos that shatter the enemy frontline, protect your key assets, and dismantle an opponent's strategy before it can begin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your true challenge lies in defeating the master strategies of other players. You will face the very armies they led to victory, their formations left behind as a challenge for all who follow. Analyze their formation, find the single flaw in their design, and deploy a counter-strategy to watch their grand design crumble to dust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick. Position. Prevail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game uses licensed assets from SMITE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Lead your team of divine allies to victory